ica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">北京大学与DeepSeek联合开源大模型推理加速框架DSpark</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">全球第四家！OpenAI 与韩国人工智能安全研究所达成深度合作</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Momenta正式启动港股IPO招股，拟募资58.9亿港元深化物理AI布局</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果Vision Pro硬件负责人保罗·米德跳槽OpenAI，加速AI原生硬件研发</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4ffa9b292743b22d3ca04e2dd58eb3da.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI近日正式聘请苹果视觉产品集团（VPG）前负责人保罗·米德（Paul Meade）加入其硬件部门，负责推动全新AI设备系列的研发。米德在苹果任职期间曾领导Apple Vision Pro硬件团队长达七年，并主导了苹果预计于2027年底发布的智能眼镜开发工作。此次人事变动正值苹果内部硬件业务重组，米德的加入被视为OpenAI在AI原生硬件领域战略布局的重大升级。此前，OpenAI已与前苹果首席设计师Jony Ive及LoveFrom团队合作成立子公司“io”，旨在打造AI原生硬件。米德带来的空间计算与可穿戴设备研发经验，将进一步强化OpenAI在AI软硬件一体化赛道的核心竞争力，标志着科技巨头在AI硬件领域的竞争进入白热化阶段。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">消息称百度昆仑芯将赴港IPO 目标估值达500亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b42360a551d2af392abf0b84b34462ba.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">消息称百度昆仑芯将赴港IPO 目标估值达500亿美元AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Jun 29, 20261596月29日，资本市场传来重磅消息，百度旗下AI芯片业务主体昆仑芯正在紧锣密鼓地推进香港首次公开募股（IPO）相关进程，目标估值高达500亿美元。作为百度AI硬件生态布局的核心板块，昆仑芯此次奔赴港股不仅是其自身资本化道路的里程碑，也为当前白热化的全球AI算力市场注入了新的催化剂。作为国内备受瞩目的AI算力企业，昆仑芯此前已成功推出多代自研AI芯片，并在云端推理等多元化算力场景中实现了大规模落地应用。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">北京大学与DeepSeek联合开源大模型推理加速框架DSpark</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dbd8258dd3c8d4d98c4d605ceca02ad6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月28日，北京大学与DeepSeek联合开源大模型推理加速框架DSpark，旨在解决高并发推理场景下的响应延迟与算力浪费问题。DSpark引入双重优化机制：在候选生成阶段采用半自回归架构，仅需两层Transformer结构即可实现优于五层并行模型的表现；在验证调度层面引入置信度调度验证机制，通过硬件感知前缀调度器减少无效计算。经通义千问3、Gemma4等模型测试，DSpark在长序列生成任务中有效缓解了候选有效率衰减难题，相较Eagle3和DFlash基线模型具备显著优势。工程层面，该框架通过序列打包降低内存消耗，并采用异步调度消除GPU流水线卡顿。目前，DSpark已应用于DeepSeek-V4-Flash与DeepSeek-V4-Pro预览版服务引擎，显著提升了系统吞吐量。深度求索已在GitHub Dee</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">全球第四家！OpenAI 与韩国人工智能安全研究所达成深度合作</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/04bd262e29e0472ec5b42c635c48be1b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI 与韩国人工智能安全研究所达成深度合作AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Jun 29, 202623在人工智能技术日新月异的今天，高风险领域的安全评估已成为全球科技发展的重中之重。就在今日，OpenAI 与韩国人工智能安全研究所正式签署了一项合作备忘录，双方将围绕高级人工智能系统在网络安全等高风险领域的评估展开全方位合作。值得一提的是，这也是 OpenAI 继与美国、英国和日本之后的第四次国家级安全合作。此次签约不仅彰显了国际社会对 AI 安全的高度重视，也标志着双方在构建信任、降低技术风险方面迈出了坚实的一步。携手攻坚高风险领域安全 根据这份备忘录，双方的合作重点将聚焦于安全评估方法、基准测试以及技术信息的深入交流。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Momenta正式启动港股IPO招股，拟募资58.9亿港元深化物理AI布局</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/254a7fe602bd869506e673d4e8f716b0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">物理AI领军企业Momenta披露全球发售文件，正式启动港股招股，股票代码为“6880”，计划全球发售约1993.8万股，定价295.6港元，预计募资总额达58.9亿港元。此次IPO吸引了包括GIC、富达国际、梅赛德斯-奔驰、比亚迪等14家机构组成的基石投资者阵容，认购总额约30亿港元。财务数据显示，Momenta 2023至2025年营收从7.43亿元增长至24.13亿元，年均复合增长率超80%，毛利率由17.5%提升至71.6%，经调整亏损收窄至3.03亿元。技术层面，公司今年4月实现R7世界模型量产，全面支撑乘用车、Robotaxi及Robovan等领域落地。本次募资净额的60%将重点用于研发核心技术及推进新一代智能驾驶解决方案，旨在加速端到端大模型时代的物理AI产业规模化进程。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
